      <p>Creators : zackman1291 & Herobrain_gamer</p>
      <p>Orignal Creators : Herobrain_gamer & ELECTICITY</p>
      <p><a class="external-links" href="https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/hollow-pvp" target="_blank">Download from CurseForge</a></p>
    </div>
    <div id="sub-section-images">
